<title>USA: Ground Round Q4 loss widens.</title>
<headline>Ground Round Q4 loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>BRAINTREE, Mass. 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Dollars in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>				     Three Months Ended  Year Ended</p>
<p>				  Sep 29,  Oct. 1,   Sep 29,  Oct. 1,</p>
<p>				    1996	1995     1996	1995</p>
<p> Revenue			$53,371  $54,926  $218,833 $230,406</p>
<p>Costs and expenses:</p>
<p> Cost of products sold     48,534   50,964   201,090  200,756</p>
<p>Selling, general and</p>
<p>  administrative		3,956    3,944    16,575   16,043</p>
<p>Depreciation and Amortization</p>
<p>				    2,820    3,569    11,884   14,667</p>
<p> Interest expense, net	1,182    1,195     4,815    4,957</p>
<p>Impairment of long lived assets</p>
<p>				    8,898	 --     8,898	 --</p>
<p> Other (income) expense     2,394	  2     2,892    1,599</p>
<p> Total			   67,784   59,674   246,154  238,022</p>
<p> Loss before taxes	 (14,413)  (4,748)  (27,321)  (7,616)</p>
<p> Income tax benefit	 (1,147)    (988)   (4,374)  (1,906)</p>
<p> Net loss		    (13,266)  (3,760)  (22,947)  (5,710)</p>
