<p>  shares outstanding	 11,174   11,174    11,174   11,151</p>
<p>Net Income (loss) per</p>
<p>  common share		 (1.19)    (.33)    (2.05)    (.51)</p>
<p>NOTES: 1996 Q4 and full year results includes charge of $8.9 million or $0.80 per share for the early adoption of SFAS 121, &quot;Accounting for Impairment of Long-Lived Assets to Be Disposed Of.&quot; Full year 1996 results reflect $2.8 million in other expenses in connection with the restructuring of an amended and restated credit agreement consisting of bank, administrative and legal fees.</p>
<p>Full company name is Ground Round Restaurants Inc</p>
